# Justified exceptions for scripts/ste-lint.py.
#
# Format: <path glob> | <rule or *> | <regular expression or *> | <reason>
# The regular expression is searched in the sentence as the tool prints it.
# A line without a reason is an error. Add an exception only for a quotation,
# a standard text, or a technical name that cannot change. Rewrite all other
# text until it passes.

CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md | * | * | Contributor Covenant 2.1, a standard text. It stays as published.
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md | * | * | Generated by scripts/third-party-notices.py from the licence texts of the dependencies. The licence texts stay as published.
